    "title": "Raya set to have scan on injury - how much would Arsenal miss him?",
    "link": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/football/articles/ckx28w9ree9vo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
    "snippet": "Arsenal goalkeeper David Raya is set to have a scan on his shoulder after going off injured during Saturday's 2-2 draw with Newcastle.",
